    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:crafting_soulforge",
      "heading": "受控炸药 II",
      "recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/vein_charge_2",
      "anchor": "controlled_charge_2",
      "text": "$(item)受控炸药 II$()的行为与$(item)受控炸药$()相同，但它一次最多可破坏8组方块。"
    },
    {
