    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:crafting_soulforge",
      "heading": "真菌炸药",
      "recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/fungal_charge",
      "anchor": "fungal_charge",
      "text": "$(item)真菌炸药$()用于砍伐巨型蘑菇，无论是在主世界还是下界。虽然怀疑你一次是否需要用这么多，但它最多可以破坏$(item)三组方块$()。"
    },
    {
      "type": "bloodmagic:3x_crafting_soulforge",
      "a.heading": "湮灭",
      "a.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/fungal_charge_voiding",
      "b.heading": "加热工具",
      "b.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/fungal_charge_smelting",
      "c.heading": "精准采集",
      "c.recipe": "bloodmagic:soulforge/fungal_charge_silk_touch"
    },
    {
